{"unit_id": "4763620150:DESCRIPTION:1140:1218", "sku": "4763620150", "surface": "DESCRIPTION", "source_file": "01_Карточки/Ozon/МегаФон/П31 СИМ РФ/4763620150/CS_54a6ab5df2bcf2072377/01_Материалы/card_data.json", "source_field": "description", "start": 1140, "end": 1218, "text": "• Скачать приложение Мегафон в Google Play, AppStore, App Gallery или RuStore.", "offset_unit": "UNICODE_CODE_POINT", "unit_kind": "SOURCE_SEGMENT", "atomicity": "SOURCE_SEGMENT_NOT_ASSUMED_SINGLE_PROPOSITION"}
{"unit_id": "4763620150:DESCRIPTION:1220:1261", "sku": "4763620150", "surface": "DESCRIPTION", "source_file": "01_Карточки/Ozon/МегаФон/П31 СИМ РФ/4763620150/CS_54a6ab5df2bcf2072377/01_Материалы/card_data.json", "source_field": "description", "start": 1220, "end": 1261, "text": "• Выбрать пункт \"Активировать SIM-карту\".", "offset_unit": "UNICODE_CODE_POINT", "unit_kind": "SOURCE_SEGMENT", "atomicity": "SOURCE_SEGMENT_NOT_ASSUMED_SINGLE_PROPOSITION"}
